{
  "id": "arthur-vo-06",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "x01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他把刚拔出来的石中剑，又插了回去。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x01.mp3",
      "bytes": 53541,
      "heard": "他把剛拔出來的時鐘鍵又插了回去",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "name": "x02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "等等，拔出来不就是国王吗？",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x02.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "等等,拔出來不就是國王嗎?",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "x03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "名著《亚瑟王之死》里，伦敦教堂院子里多了块大石头，插着把剑。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x03.mp3",
      "bytes": 94501,
      "heard": "鳴住雅瑟王之死裡倫敦教堂院子裡多了快大石頭插著把劍",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 5.84
    },
    {
      "name": "x04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "金字写着：谁拔出来，谁就是国王。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x04.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "金字寫著誰拔出來誰就是國王",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "name": "x05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "贵族排队来拔，脸都憋红了，剑一动不动。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x05.mp3",
      "bytes": 71514,
      "heard": "贵族排队来拔,脸都憋红了,见一动不动",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "name": "x06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "新年比武大会，亚瑟的哥哥叫凯，刚当上骑士，一摸腰，剑忘带了。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x06.mp3",
      "bytes": 109966,
      "heard": "新年比武大会,雅瑟的哥哥叫凯,刚当上骑士,一摸腰见忘袋了。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 6.8
    },
    {
      "name": "x07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "亚瑟回去拿，家里没人，全看比武去了。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x07.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "雅瑟回去拿,家裡沒人,全看比武去了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "name": "x08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他想起石头上还插着一把。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x08.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "他想起石頭上還插著一把",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "x09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "连十个守卫都看比武去了，他一拔就出来，第一次。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x09.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "連十個守衛都看比武去了他一拔就出來第一次",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "x10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "凯拿到剑就找爸爸：“爸，石中剑！我要当国王了！”",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x10.mp3",
      "bytes": 72767,
      "heard": "凱拿到箭就找爸爸爸 十中箭我要当国王了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 4.48
    },
    {
      "name": "x11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "爸爸让他发誓，凯才承认是弟弟拿的。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x11.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "爸爸讓他發誓凱財承認是弟弟拿的",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "x12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "爸爸让亚瑟插回去再拔一次，他说：“这有什么难的。”",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x12.mp3",
      "bytes": 75275,
      "heard": "爸爸讓亞瑟插回去再拔一次他說這有什麼難的",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "name": "x13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "爸爸先拔，不动；凯使出吃奶的劲，不动；亚瑟一伸手，第二次。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x13.mp3",
      "bytes": 108712,
      "heard": "爸爸先拔,不動開始出吃奶的鏡,不動亞瑟一伸手,第二次",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 6.72
    },
    {
      "name": "x14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "几天后贵族全来试，只有他拔得出，第三次。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x14.mp3",
      "bytes": 80291,
      "heard": "幾天後貴族全來事,只有他拔得出,第三次",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "name": "x15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他们气炸了：“让个出身不高的小子管我们？”说改天再拔。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x15.mp3",
      "bytes": 90740,
      "heard": "他們氣炸了,讓個出身不高的小子管我們,說改天再拔",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 5.6
    },
    {
      "name": "x16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "二月，雪还没化，第四次，又拖。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x16.mp3",
      "bytes": 69006,
      "heard": "2月,雪還沒化,第四次,又脫",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "name": "x17",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "春天，花都开了，第五次，还拖。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x17.mp3",
      "bytes": 63990,
      "heard": "春天,花都開了,第五次,還脫",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "name": "x18",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "初夏，当着所有人的面，第六次。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x18.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "出下,当着所有人的面第六次",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "x19",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "老百姓急了：“就要亚瑟当国王，别再拖了！”",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x19.mp3",
      "bytes": 62318,
      "heard": "老百姓急了就要雅瑟當國王別再拖了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "name": "x20",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "所有人齐刷刷跪下。",
      "voice": "shared:Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly",
      "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "x20.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "所有人齊刷刷跪下",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
